[{:db/id 17592186078494 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-57b50761-0ebc-5773-b974-58926652c62b"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186078495 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-aecf7af1-6026-52e6-a339-611dfc1550ce"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186078496 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-ab1d8df9-7551-58b4-b23c-3a36ae997ae9"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186078339 :question/problem "Given that $y = y(x)$ satisfies the equation $y''+7y'+6y = 0,$ which of the following could **not** be $y(x)?$\n\nI. $-3e^{-6x}$\n\nII. $2e^{-6x}-4e^{-x}$\n\nIII. $e^{-6x}+2e^{x}$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "question-57b50761-0ebc-5773-b974-58926652c62b" :question/id #uuid "57b50761-0ebc-5773-b974-58926652c62b" :question/math-academy-id "q-129835" :question/problem "Consider the equation ${y}^{″}-12{y}^{′}+35y=0$ where $y=y(x).$ If $y={e}^{\\lambda x}$ is a solution, then $\\lambda =$" :question/worked-solution "Assuming $y={e}^{\\lambda x}$ and differentiating $y$ with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x},\\,{y}^{″}={\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our differential equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}-12\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x}+35{e}^{\\lambda x} & =0 \\\\ {e}^{\\lambda x}({\\lambda }^{2}-12\\lambda +35) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation is therefore\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}-12\\lambda +35 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFactoring the auxiliary equation results in\n\n$$\n(\\lambda -5)(\\lambda -7)=0,\n$$\n\nand so the solutions of the auxiliary equation  are $\\lambda =5$ or $\\lambda =7.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-dafe6fcf-90f7-529a-8290-8d2af8b5a7f5"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-dafe6fcf-90f7-529a-8290-8d2af8b5a7f5" :answer-field/id #uuid "dafe6fcf-90f7-529a-8290-8d2af8b5a7f5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-7fa54804-bed0-557a-ba9a-e0d7bcc11265" :answer-field/choices ["answer-912dd08d-5db0-5a08-ab81-5772fdca1e70" "answer-41908330-21d9-59d9-a0b2-a53e1593c36e" "answer-3b840a02-6e20-5e04-b9ba-9bc1e18883f2" "answer-4eb31420-e922-5f6e-bedb-6f1ece717ad4" "answer-7fa54804-bed0-557a-ba9a-e0d7bcc11265"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-912dd08d-5db0-5a08-ab81-5772fdca1e70" :answer/id #uuid "912dd08d-5db0-5a08-ab81-5772fdca1e70" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$-3$ or $4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-41908330-21d9-59d9-a0b2-a53e1593c36e" :answer/id #uuid "41908330-21d9-59d9-a0b2-a53e1593c36e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$-4$ or $-3$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3b840a02-6e20-5e04-b9ba-9bc1e18883f2" :answer/id #uuid "3b840a02-6e20-5e04-b9ba-9bc1e18883f2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$-5$ or $7$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4eb31420-e922-5f6e-bedb-6f1ece717ad4" :answer/id #uuid "4eb31420-e922-5f6e-bedb-6f1ece717ad4" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$3$ or $4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7fa54804-bed0-557a-ba9a-e0d7bcc11265" :answer/id #uuid "7fa54804-bed0-557a-ba9a-e0d7bcc11265" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$5$ or $7$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-aecf7af1-6026-52e6-a339-611dfc1550ce" :question/id #uuid "aecf7af1-6026-52e6-a339-611dfc1550ce" :question/math-academy-id "q-90715" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}-7\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+12y=0.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let $y={e}^{\\lambda x}.$ Differentiating $y$ with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x},\\,\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}={\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our differential equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}-7\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x}+12{e}^{\\lambda x} & =0 \\\\ {e}^{\\lambda x}({\\lambda }^{2}-7\\lambda +12) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation is therefore\n\n$$\n{\\lambda }^{2}-7\\lambda +12=0.\n$$\n\nFactoring the auxiliary equation results in\n\n$$\n(\\lambda -3)(\\lambda -4)=0,\n$$\n\nand so $\\lambda =3$ or $\\lambda =4.$ \n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation is\n\n$$\ny=A{e}^{3x}+B{e}^{4x}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-390cf455-f96c-59d6-8b71-3d6a053b53ef"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-390cf455-f96c-59d6-8b71-3d6a053b53ef" :answer-field/id #uuid "390cf455-f96c-59d6-8b71-3d6a053b53ef" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-c1df491c-fb96-5d15-b8cb-b70016700d43" :answer-field/choices ["answer-43359a46-a31b-5979-b00d-e832c7aab359" "answer-b72954b9-0f27-5ed9-92fd-03be2ce3c9bc" "answer-7d5b35fd-08b6-534e-aef6-d64720abed6e" "answer-c1df491c-fb96-5d15-b8cb-b70016700d43" "answer-8b32650e-a838-5e42-b674-904b88326a9b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-43359a46-a31b-5979-b00d-e832c7aab359" :answer/id #uuid "43359a46-a31b-5979-b00d-e832c7aab359" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=A{e}^{-2x}+B{e}^{-6x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b72954b9-0f27-5ed9-92fd-03be2ce3c9bc" :answer/id #uuid "b72954b9-0f27-5ed9-92fd-03be2ce3c9bc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=A{e}^{-3x}+B{e}^{-4x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7d5b35fd-08b6-534e-aef6-d64720abed6e" :answer/id #uuid "7d5b35fd-08b6-534e-aef6-d64720abed6e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=A{e}^{2x}+B{e}^{6x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c1df491c-fb96-5d15-b8cb-b70016700d43" :answer/id #uuid "c1df491c-fb96-5d15-b8cb-b70016700d43" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=A{e}^{3x}+B{e}^{4x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8b32650e-a838-5e42-b674-904b88326a9b" :answer/id #uuid "8b32650e-a838-5e42-b674-904b88326a9b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=A{e}^{x}+B{e}^{12x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-ab1d8df9-7551-58b4-b23c-3a36ae997ae9" :question/id #uuid "ab1d8df9-7551-58b4-b23c-3a36ae997ae9" :question/math-academy-id "q-130122" :question/problem "Given that $y=y(x)$ satisfies the equation ${y}^{″}-6{y}^{′}-7y=0,$ which of the following **cannot** be $y(x)?$" :question/worked-solution "Assuming $y={e}^{\\lambda x}$ and differentiating $y$ with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x},\\,{y}^{″}={\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our differential equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}-6\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x}-7{e}^{\\lambda x} & =0 \\\\ {e}^{\\lambda x}({\\lambda }^{2}-6\\lambda -7) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation is therefore\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}-6\\lambda -7 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFactoring the auxiliary equation results in\n\n$$\n(\\lambda +1)(\\lambda -7)=0,\n$$\n\nand so the solutions of the auxiliary equation  are $\\lambda =-1$ or $\\lambda =7.$\n\nTherefore, any linear combination of the functions ${e}^{-x}$ and ${e}^{7x}$ is a solution to the original differential equation. \n\nAmong the given options, only ${e}^{6x}+{e}^{7x}$ is not a solution." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-4c296597-6c06-5bf8-aa85-d5015907d1ee"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-4c296597-6c06-5bf8-aa85-d5015907d1ee" :answer-field/id #uuid "4c296597-6c06-5bf8-aa85-d5015907d1ee" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-a500bf2b-0bcf-52aa-8621-3db9d47c8750" :answer-field/choices ["answer-646c2a9c-ee6b-59ef-abca-48eaa42e7b25" "answer-47caa681-8680-5312-9d36-19b2868656e2" "answer-4deac328-5c08-5937-b799-6f57cf09acfc" "answer-f5419660-dfd9-56ab-8bf3-1a8501f74f1f" "answer-a500bf2b-0bcf-52aa-8621-3db9d47c8750"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-646c2a9c-ee6b-59ef-abca-48eaa42e7b25" :answer/id #uuid "646c2a9c-ee6b-59ef-abca-48eaa42e7b25" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-6{e}^{-x}-7{e}^{7x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-47caa681-8680-5312-9d36-19b2868656e2" :answer/id #uuid "47caa681-8680-5312-9d36-19b2868656e2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7{e}^{7x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4deac328-5c08-5937-b799-6f57cf09acfc" :answer/id #uuid "4deac328-5c08-5937-b799-6f57cf09acfc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{-x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f5419660-dfd9-56ab-8bf3-1a8501f74f1f" :answer/id #uuid "f5419660-dfd9-56ab-8bf3-1a8501f74f1f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{-x}+{e}^{7x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a500bf2b-0bcf-52aa-8621-3db9d47c8750" :answer/id #uuid "a500bf2b-0bcf-52aa-8621-3db9d47c8750" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{6x}+{e}^{7x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186078644 :activity/expected-seconds 420.0 :db/ensure [:activity/validate]}]
